# Toolbox crontab — one line per job. Times are America/New_York
# (TZ is set in docker-compose.yml). Scripts live in ./scripts on the
# host (mounted at /scripts) and must be executable (chmod +x).
# The ">> /proc/1/fd/1 2>&1" tail sends job output to the container
# log — read it with: docker logs toolbox
# After editing this file: docker compose restart toolbox
#
# Example (commented out): health check every 6 hours
# 0 */6 * * * /scripts/example-health.sh >> /proc/1/fd/1 2>&1
